1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,440
Welcome to the unit, weather and seasons. B.

2
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:11,630
Amy and Simon are talking about their favourite seasons.

3
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:16,800
Work in pairs and talk about which season you like best.

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,115
Use the conversation below as a model.

5
00:00:21,115 --> 00:00:25,550
Which season do you like best, Simon?

6
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:28,540
I like autumn best.

7
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,700
Why do you like it?

8
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:34,770
The weather is very nice in autumn.

9
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:39,440
It's the best time to play football outside.

10
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:45,350
Yeah, and the trees are colourful in autumn. That's true.

11
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:48,660
It's a beautiful time of year.

12
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:52,380
So, which is your favourite season?

13
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:56,250
I like summer best. Why?

14
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:58,060
Summer is so hot.

15
00:00:58,060 --> 00:01:03,890
Yes, but we can go swimming and enjoy ice cream.
